ID=p1
UNIT=U1-types
TITLE=Practice: union-typed label function with narrowing
DESC=Write a function label that takes a number|string id and returns a string label, using typeof narrowing.
TPL=unionfn
FILES=single
PARAMS:
fn=label
param=id
union=number | string
ret=string
sbranch=return "ID-" + id.toUpperCase();
nbranch=return "ID-" + id;
ENDPARAMS
TESTS:
console.log(label(7));
console.log(label("abc"));
ENDTESTS
EXPECT:
ID-7
ID-ABC
ENDEXPECT
